fixture cam_updash
doc BUILD.md s5 Dash "8-way"; Jump "Double jump"; docs/adr/0011: the highest, fastest rise (jump, air jump, up-dash) stays clear of the view's edge by the follow alone
room test/camera
spawn 300 1920
frames 150
input
  0..22 jump
  23 jump !jump
  24..44 jump
  45 U dash
  46..60 U
end
expect
  at 0 event.jump=1
  at 23 event.air_jump=1
  at 45 event.dash=1
  mark land 46..149 event.land=1
  at land y=1920u
end
